sbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKATA, KOUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUTSUMI, SHUSAKU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A heat transpiration preparation whereby a chemical can be efficiently transpired. The heat transpiration preparation is in the form of a solid at ordinary temperatures but liquefied as a whole when molten by heating, and the chemical serving as the active component among the components thereof is transpired from the thus liquefied preparation.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une préparation de transpiration thermique permettant une transpiration efficace d'un agent chimique. Cette préparation de transpiration thermique se présente sous la forme d'un solide à une température normale mais se liquéfie dans son ensemble une fois chauffée afin d'être fondue, ce qui entraîne la transpiration dudit agent chimique faisant office de principe actif parmi les constituants de cette préparation liquéfiée.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>